    {
      "name": "Spray Blinding Musk",
      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The giant skunk propels potent, acrid musk in a 15ft Cone. Each creature in the line must attempt a DC 17 Fortitude Saving Throw save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target is Sickened 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is Sickened 3.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target is Blinded for 1 round, becomes Sickened 3, and takes a -2 penalty to Stealth checks from the horrific odor for 24 hours or until the musk is removed or neutralized, requiring 10 minutes of thorough scrubbing with soap.</p>\n<p>Effect: Musk</p>",
